            <a id="ntr4-L_2009061EN.01000101-E0004" href="#ntc4-L_2009061EN.01000101-E0004"
               >(<span class="oj-super">4</span>)</a>  See Annex I.</p>
      </div>
      <hr class="oj-doc-sep"/>
      <div id="L_2009061EN.01000401">
         <div class="eli-container" id="anx_I">
            <p class="oj-doc-ti" id="d1e32-4-1">ANNEX I</p>
            <p id="d1e38-4-1" class="oj-ti-grseq-1">PART A</p>
            <p id="L_2009061EN.01000401-g-001-0001" class="oj-ti-grseq-1">Repealed Regulation with its successive amendment</p>
            <p class="oj-ti-grseq-1">
               <span class="oj-sp-normal">(referred to in Article 4)</span>
            </p>
            <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="oj-table">
               <col width="59%"/>
               <col width="41%"/>
               <tbody>
                  <tr class="oj-table">
                     <td valign="top" class="oj-table"  >
                        <p class="oj-tbl-txt">Regulation (EEC) No 1017/68 of the Council</p>
                        <p class="oj-tbl-txt">(<a href="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/oj/JOL_1968_175_R_TOC"
                              >OJ L 175, 23.7.1968, p. 1</a>)</p>
                     </td>
                     <td valign="top" class="oj-table"  >
                        <p class="oj-tbl-txt">except Article 13(3)</p>
                     </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="oj-table">
                     <td valign="top" class="oj-table"  >
                        <p class="oj-tbl-txt">Council Regulation (EC) No 1/2003</p>
                        <p class="oj-tbl-txt">(<a href="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/oj/JOL_2003_001_R_TOC"
                              >OJ L 1, 4.1.2003, p. 1</a>)</p>
                     </td>
                     <td valign="top" class="oj-table"  >
                        <p class="oj-tbl-txt">Article 36 only</p>
                     </td>
                  </tr>
